## Next Steps for You

To make this pipeline functional, you need to add the following **Repository Secrets** to your GitHub repository by going to **Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions**:

| Secret Name | Description | Example |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `SSH_HOST` | The IP address or hostname of your VPS. | `192.168.1.1` |
| `SSH_USERNAME` | The SSH username to log in with. | `root` or `jinesh` |
| `SSH_PRIVATE_KEY` | Your private SSH key (usually from `~/.ssh/id_rsa` or similar). | `-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----...` |
